    "darkAdapted": false,
    "isDigitalEntity": false,
    "notes": "<p><i>Millennia ago, the Heptilotl glutted on the biomass of its flooded jungle world, devouring flora and fauna until it was barren, then coiled into a chrysalis amid its flooded crystal caverns. Some centuries later, a giant meteor shattered the Heptilotl's planet, flinging its still-intact hibernation cave as a rogue asteroid through the void. Recently, prospectors have set up shop on this asteroid, looking for xenominerals and unaware of the beast's ravenous maw, ready to wake at any time.</i></p><p><strong>Movement:</strong> NEAR (climb, swim)</p>",
    "description": "<p><strong>Attacks:</strong> 2 rend (NEAR) +9 (1d10) and bite +9(2d10) or tongue lash and bite +9 (2d10) or shock burst.</p><p><strong>Legendary.</strong> Only damaged by Triad or enhanced weapon damage. Triad Powers targeting the Heptilotl are DC 18.</p><p><strong>Tremorhunt.</strong> Detects vibrations through water and floors well enough to count as vision.</p><p><strong>Impervious.</strong> Immune to electricity.</p><p><strong>Swallow.</strong> On a natural bite attack roll of 17-20, target is swallowed. Total darkness inside and 2d10 damage per round. Heptitol regurgitates all swallowed if dealt at least 20 damage in one round to the inside of its gullet.</p><p>Tongue</p><p><strong>Lash.</strong> One target within NEAR, DC 15 DEX save pulled CLOSE and MV becomes 0. The target may make a DC 15 STR save on its turn to resume movement as normal. Tongue Lash can reach through doors and vents or around corners.</p><p>Shock</p><p><strong>Burst.</strong> Area blast within NEAR (flooded areas only), DC 15 CON save or 2d8 damage; fries nearby electronics (locks short, lights flicker, comms jam).</p><p><strong>Hibernate.</strong> While underwater, forms into a crystalline cocoon and heals 1d4 HP per round. While in this form, may remain dormant and hidden indefinitely. Shattering the crystal awakens the</p><p><strong>Heptilotl.</strong> \"The chrysalis cracked... and hunger uncoiled from the void.\" \u2014</p><p><strong>Dr.</strong> Lir Voss, Final Transmission</p>",
    "source": {
      "title": "darkspace"
    }
  },
